## 209. Answers — Level 4

34. Fish : Ocean — the first three represent animal → home/shelter more directly; Fish → Ocean is animal → habitat.

38. Student : Book — the first three are person → workplace/place of activity; Student → Book is person → object.

42. Chair : Table — the first three are parts/components associated with a larger object/vehicle structure, while Chair → Table is object-to-object association.

> **Note:** Pair-classification questions can be context-sensitive. In an actual exam, the answer choices and exact wording determine the intended relationship.

